# BUILD AURELIX AI — PREMIUM PREDICTIVE HEALTH INTELLIGENCE ERP

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, modern, premium-quality, interactive healthcare ERP frontend called **Aurelix AI**, with the tagline:

**Predictive Health Intelligence — Earlier Insights. Better Decisions.**

This is a healthcare decision-support prototype focused on:

- AI-powered early risk detection
- Diabetic retinopathy screening
- Chronic kidney disease risk assessment and monitoring
- Diabetes and metabolic health monitoring
- Longitudinal patient health analytics
- Explainable AI insights
- Clinical decision support
- Doctor-supervised clinical workflows

The application must look like a real, sophisticated hospital intelligence platform suitable for an innovation competition, university demonstration, or healthcare technology exhibition.

**Critical clinical principle:** The system identifies possible risks and organizes evidence. It never claims to diagnose patients independently. All clinical findings, decisions, and recommendations require qualified healthcare professional review.

This is a **frontend-only prototype** using synthetic data. There is no real medical AI model, authentication service, database, or backend.

Every AI result, evaluation metric, prediction, or risk score must be visibly identified as synthetic, simulated, or illustrative. Never present demo results as real clinical validation.

